/'
    Project: SQLite FreeBASIC port

    File: sqlite3_fts5_varint_types.bi

    Purpose:

        Hold the C ABI aliases generated for the FTS5 varint source unit.

    Responsibilities:

        - Define source-unit types needed by the generated varint procedures.
        - Keep C2FB declarations scoped to the FTS5 feature build.

    This file intentionally does NOT contain:

        - Varint algorithms or module registration.
        - Test code.
'/
/'
    Generated generic C ABI declarations
    Source: ext/fts5/fts5_varint.c
    Generated by fb_tools/c2fb/c2fb.bas. Review before relying on a declaration.
'/
